@base = http://localhost:4000/api

### 1. All orders (should return 12)
GET {{base}}/orders

### 2. Filter by area (should return 4 Bole orders)
GET {{base}}/orders?area=Bole

### 3. One order
GET {{base}}/orders/1

### 4. Missing order (500 for now, 404 comes on Day 58)
GET {{base}}/orders/999

### 5. Valid POST (should return 201 with id 13)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test User",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": 25000,
  "phone": "0911234567"
}

### 6. Invalid POST: negative total (should return 400, not 500)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test User",
  "area": "Bole",
  "totalSantim": -5
}

### 7. Extra field gets stripped (isAdmin must not appear in the response)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test User",
  "area": "Piassa",
  "totalSantim": 10000,
  "isAdmin": true
}

### 8. Bad area and phone (should return 400 with two messages)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Test User",
  "area": "London",
  "totalSantim": 10000,
  "phone": "12345"
}
#### 9. All restaurants (should return 3)
GET {{base}}/restaurants/1